  "details": "Apologies if this is a duplicate the canny search is not the greatest :)\n\nAs there are already some groups popping up with malicious names and especially banners I think the following points should be considered for displaying group banners/names:\n\n- add display of group banners/names to the safety options (similar to User Icons)\n\n- streamer and safe mode should affect the display of group banners/names\n\n- the set safety options or modes should also affect the display on the profile page of a user and not just the nameplate\n\nThe current option to generally hide the Group Nameplate Banners in the quick menu is not sufficient in my opinion.\n\nThank you.",
